{"id":148305327,"slug":"dont-lie-to-congress-advice-to-the","title":"Don't Lie to Congress: Advice to the Leadership of Pharmacy Benefit Managers","subtitle":"Tragically too late...","post_date":"2024-08-30T14:53:19.985Z","audience":"everyone","type":"podcast","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/dont-lie-to-congress-advice-to-the","wordcount":96,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:51:43.575Z","body_sha256":"7e60e4b4507caa2cf827de0177835be169937ec59e14117cf3e1b9ceb220974b","text_words":95,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>Recently, the leadership of all three big health PBMs testified in front of Congress…and…<a href=\"https://oversight.house.gov/release/chairman-comer-calls-on-pbm-executives-to-correct-hearing-testimony/\">have now been asked to correct the congressional record.</a></p><p>So, I made a podcast instead of an article about it today cause my kids are away, and I love the format.  I hope you all enjoy it.  The transcript is in the top right if you just want to read, and not listen!</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/dont-lie-to-congress-advice-to-the?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/dont-lie-to-congress-advice-to-the?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><p></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!O3xu!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe09ffd1e-30b1-460b-ad59-6a91cb31cb64_1144x806.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"imag